OL,3,AMelania Trump calls for lasting Ukraine
OL,4,Atruce as she hosts Russian and
OL,5,AUkrainian officials
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS First Lady Melania Trump called for
OL,8,Fa "more enduring" ceasefire in Ukraine
OL,9,Fas she welcomed Russian and Ukrainian
OL,10,Fdelegations at the White House
OL,11,Ffollowing last week's truce in the
OL,12,Fsouthern region of Kherson.
OL,14,FHundreds of residents of the
OL,15,FRussian-occupied Ukrainian town of
OL,16,FOleshky facing starvation and constant
OL,17,Fbombardment were able to evacuate
OL,18,Fduring a six-day ceasefire, which both
OL,19,FMoscow and Kyiv credited Trump with
OL,20,Fbrokering.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
