OL,3,AMelania Trump calls for lasting Ukraine
OL,4,Atruce as she hosts Russian and
OL,5,AUkrainian officials
OL,6,
OL,7,F"The lives of innocent people must
OL,8,Ftranscend the division of war. I hope
OL,9,FOleshky inspires greater peace," she
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe unusual White House event saw
OL,13,Fsenior Ukrainian and Russian officials
OL,14,Fmeet away from the setting of official
OL,15,FUS-brokered peace talks they have been
OL,16,Fholding without success since last
OL,17,Fyear.
